      "text": "R = []\nfor n in range(1, 1000):\n    s = f'{n:b}'   # s = bin(n)[2:]\n    if n % 2 == 0:\n        s = s + '10'\n    else:\n        s = '1' + s + '01'\n    r = int(s, 2)\n    if n < 11:\n        R.append(r)\nprint(min(R))"
